OL,3,GNEWSAI couldn't live with the agony of
OL,4,Amigraines anymore but my GP called me
OL,5,Adramatic
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This article contains details
OL,8,Fof mental health struggles including
OL,9,Freferences to suicide
OL,11,FWhen Lauren Evans told her doctor she
OL,12,Fwas suicidal because of the "pure
OL,13,Fagony" of her chronic migraine, she was
OL,14,Ftold she was being dramatic.
OL,16,FLauren, 29, was seven when she got her
OL,17,Ffirst migraine and went on to have them
OL,18,Fregularly - by the time she was 24,
OL,19,Fthey were happening every day.
